sequenceDiagram
    participant Buyer
    participant OrderSvc as order-service
    participant IdentitySvc as identity-service
    participant CatalogSvc as catalog-service
    participant MerchantSvc as merchant-service
    participant PromoSvc as promotion-service
    participant PaymentSvc as payment-service
    participant Kafka
    participant InvSvc as inventory-service
    participant PlatformSvc as platform-service

    Buyer->>OrderSvc: POST /orders/checkout + Idempotency-Key (lines, coupon?, cardNumber, expectedTotal)
    opt same key seen before
        OrderSvc-->>Buyer: 200 the order as it stands (same body) or 409 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED
    end
    OrderSvc->>IdentitySvc: GET /accounts/{id} (sync, buyer's token, live buyer-active check)
    IdentitySvc-->>OrderSvc: buyerActive, merchantId
    break buyer deactivated
        OrderSvc-->>Buyer: 403 BUYER_DEACTIVATED, nothing created
    end
    OrderSvc->>CatalogSvc: GET /internal/products?ids= (sync, internal key)
    CatalogSvc-->>OrderSvc: price, active, merchantActive, stockRow per product
    OrderSvc->>MerchantSvc: GET /internal/merchants?ids= (sync, internal key)
    MerchantSvc-->>OrderSvc: active, commissionRate per merchant
    break a line not purchasable, or the total is not expectedTotal
        OrderSvc-->>Buyer: 409 CART_NOT_PURCHASABLE or PRICE_CHANGED, nothing created
    end
    opt couponCode (refused with 400 until promotion-service exists)
        OrderSvc->>PromoSvc: GET /coupons/validate (sync)
        PromoSvc-->>OrderSvc: valid, discount amount
    end
    Note over OrderSvc,PromoSvc: any service unavailable: 503, nothing created

    OrderSvc->>OrderSvc: one transaction: Order PENDING, legs, commission rate snapshot, outbox rows
    OrderSvc-->>Buyer: 202 Location /orders/{reference}
    Note over Buyer,OrderSvc: the Buyer app polls GET /orders/{reference} from here on
    OrderSvc->>Kafka: relay publishes MerchantChargeRequested (per merchant)
    OrderSvc->>Kafka: relay publishes StockReserveRequested (per product line)

    par For each merchant
        Kafka->>PaymentSvc: MerchantChargeRequested
        PaymentSvc->>PaymentSvc: authorize + capture
        alt approved
            PaymentSvc->>Kafka: MerchantCharged
        else declined
            PaymentSvc->>Kafka: MerchantDeclined
        end
    and For each product line
        Kafka->>InvSvc: StockReserveRequested
        InvSvc->>InvSvc: Redis EVAL atomic pre-check + decrement
        InvSvc->>InvSvc: Postgres conditional UPDATE + StockReservation (commit)
        alt sufficient stock
            InvSvc->>Kafka: StockReserved
        else insufficient stock
            InvSvc->>Kafka: StockReservationFailed
        end
    end

    Kafka->>OrderSvc: charge results + reservation results
    Note over OrderSvc: each result applied under the order's row lock, so one decides

    alt all merchants charged AND all stock reserved
        OrderSvc->>OrderSvc: Order.status = SUCCEEDED
        OrderSvc->>Kafka: publish OrderSucceeded (with commission per merchant)
        Kafka->>PromoSvc: OrderSucceeded (mark coupon used)
        Kafka->>PlatformSvc: OrderSucceeded (update GMV/commission projection)
        Note over InvSvc: no action needed - stock already<br/>committed at reservation time
    else at least one declined OR out of stock OR no result by the deadline (2 min)
        OrderSvc->>OrderSvc: Order.status = FAILING (unanswered legs TIMED_OUT, unsent requests cancelled)
        par Compensate charged merchants
            OrderSvc->>Kafka: publish MerchantRefundRequested (per charged merchant)
            Kafka->>PaymentSvc: MerchantRefundRequested
            PaymentSvc->>PaymentSvc: refund
            PaymentSvc->>Kafka: MerchantRefunded
        and Compensate reserved stock
            OrderSvc->>Kafka: publish StockReleaseRequested (per reserved line, and per line with no result)
            Kafka->>InvSvc: StockReleaseRequested
            InvSvc->>InvSvc: Postgres mark reservation RELEASED + increment (or tombstone), then Redis increment
            InvSvc->>Kafka: StockReleased
        end
        opt a refund or release not confirmed
            OrderSvc->>Kafka: resend, 3 times, 1 min apart
            OrderSvc->>OrderSvc: then leg STUCK, order stays FAILING, needsAttention for Admin
        end
        Kafka->>OrderSvc: all refunds + all releases confirmed, every leg settled
        OrderSvc->>OrderSvc: Order.status = FAILED
        OrderSvc->>Kafka: publish OrderFailed (reasons per failed leg)
    end

    opt late MerchantCharged for a leg that timed out
        Kafka->>OrderSvc: MerchantCharged
        OrderSvc->>OrderSvc: FAILED back to FAILING
        OrderSvc->>Kafka: publish MerchantRefundRequested
        Kafka->>OrderSvc: MerchantRefunded
        OrderSvc->>OrderSvc: Order.status = FAILED
        OrderSvc->>Kafka: publish OrderFailed again (new eventId)
    end
